==Event Information==
Incredible!! Spectacular!!!! {{Color|#FF00FF|'''35 Million Downloads'''}} Worldwide!<br>
Time to celebrate!!!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between May 1st (11:00am) and May 15th, 2018 (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Special Celebration'''}}<br>
May 1st (11am) thru May 4th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Ultra Celebration'''}}<br>
May 4th (11am) thru May 6th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Miracle Celebration'''}}<br>
May 6th (11am) thru May 8th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Wonderful Celebration'''}}<br>
May 8th (11am) thru May 10th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Excellent Celebration'''}}<br>
May 10th (11am) thru May 12th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Grand Jubilee!'''}}<br>
May 12th (11am) thru May 15th (11am)

Clear these stages for a chance to collect tons of XP!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Half-Off Energy for Story Mode Chapters!'''}}<br>
Conquer the Future and the Past!<br>
On Even Days, play {{Color|#008000|'''"Empire of Cats" Stages'''}} for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''half the Energy cost'''}}, or login on Odd Days to play {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Into the Future" Stages'''}} at a special Energy discount!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available May 2nd (12:00am) through May 15th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
Clear the Story Modes to power up your Cats with Treasure and XP!<br>
<small><small>※Clear Empire of Cats Ch. 1 to receive the Half-Off Energy benefit.<br>
※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
May 1st (11:00am) thru May 8th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
May 8th (11:00am) thru May 15th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catamin/Catseye Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
On the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between normal Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catamin/Catseye Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Speed up your Gamatoto! Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catamin Capsules'''}}<br>
May 1st (11:00am) thru May 8th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catseye Capsules'''}}<br>
May 8th (11:00am) thru May 15th (10:59am)<br>
<small><small>※The Catseye Limited Capsules provide Catseyes and XP rewards, while Catamin Limited Capsules will provide Catamin and XP!<br>
※The Catamin Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 1 "Greece" is cleared. Catseye Limited Capsules will appear after User Rank 1600 is achieved.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this Celebration Campaign, every day you visit the Cat Base you will be rewarded with a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} present!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

